# Mizan Architectural Invariants & Rules

When generating or modifying code in this repository, you MUST strictly adhere to:
1. docs/ARCHITECTURAL_RULES.md
2. ARCHITECTURE_RULES.md

Summary of Critical Invariants:
1. CLEAN ARCHITECTURE DEPENDENCY DIRECTION:
   CoinFlow.App -> CoinFlow.UI -> CoinFlow.Application -> CoinFlow.Domain
   Infrastructure -> Application + Domain
   Domain and Application must NEVER depend on UI or presentation formatters.
2. NO GOD VIEWMODELS:
   ViewModels must not exceed 350 lines. Split large ViewModels into child ViewModels or component ViewModels.
3. NO UI DEPENDENCIES IN VIEWMODELS:
   ViewModels must never reference `Page`, `NavigationPage`, `Shell.Current`, `Window`, or MAUI UI Controls.
   Use `INavigationService` and `IDialogService`.
4. NO SERVICE LOCATOR:
   Never inject `IServiceProvider` into ViewModels or Pages. Use constructor injection.
5. NO ASYNC VOID:
   All async methods in ViewModels and Services must return `Task` or `ValueTask`.
6. NO CODE METRIC / FILE STRING TESTS:
   Never write tests that read source code files using `File.ReadAllText`. Write real behavioral unit tests with mocks.
